
Example:
./make_cfht_targets.py --ra 300 360 --dec -15 -13 --filter M4376 --non-overlapping --overwrite

Targets must have IN_IBIS=1, IN_HSC!=1, and DONE=0, as well as match the
requested RA, DEC, and filter. HSC targets are excluded before non-overlap trimming.
The input must include IN_HSC so the exclusion can always be applied.

By default, any PROGRAM is selected, including an empty string. To restrict
selection, supply one or more names (the input must then include PROGRAM):
./make_cfht_targets.py --program LBNL
./make_cfht_targets.py --program LBNL NAOC
./make_cfht_targets.py --program ""

Program matching ignores case. Future program names are accepted without changing the script;
multiple --program options are combined into one list.

Additional targets for NAOC time
./make_cfht_targets.py --ra 234 250 --dec 4 10 --filter M4376 --non-overlapping --overwrite --prefix targets-2026-09-08-A
./make_cfht_targets.py --ra 307 360 --dec -12 -6 --filter M4376 --non-overlapping --overwrite --prefix targets-2026-09-08-B
./make_cfht_targets.py --ra 0 56 --dec -15 -7 --filter M4376 --non-overlapping --overwrite --prefix targets-2026-09-08-C
./make_cfht_targets.py --ra 130 225 --dec -7 1 --filter M4376 --non-overlapping --overwrite --prefix targets-2026-09-08-D
